list.item:
Fahd ibn Abd al-Aziz
                                al-Saud, Prince Saudi Minister of the Interior;
                        Second Deputy Prime Minister

Hartman, Arthur
                                A., Staff Director, Under Secretaries Committee;
                        Assistant Secretary of State for European Affairs from January 1974

Howe, Jonathan
                                T., Commander, USN;
                        member, National Security Council staff

Kennedy, Richard
                                T., Colonel, USA;
                        member, National Security Council staff from 1970 until 1972

Lincoln, George A.
                                (Abe), General, USA;
                        Director, Office of Emergency Preparedness from 1969 until 1973

Rockefeller,
                                David, Vice Chairman, Rockefeller Brothers Fund;
                        Chief Executive Officer, Chase Manhattan Bank

Schiller,
                            Karl, West German Minister of Economics until July 1972;
                        also, Minister of Finance from May 1971 until July 1972

Train,
                            Russell, Under Secretary of the Interior until 1970;
                        Chairman, Council on Environmental Quality from 1970 until 1973;
                        Administrator of the Environmental Protection Agency from May 1973

person.note:
brother-in-law to King Faisal,
                    adviser to King Faisal of Saudi Arabia;
                    Chief of the Saudi Intelligence Secretariat

West German Minister for Economics and Minister of Finance from July 1972
                    until November 1972; Minister of Finance from December 1972 until May 1974;
                    Chancellor from May 1974

Deputy Secretary of the Treasury from January 22, 1973, until May 8, 1974;
                    Administrator, Federal Energy Office, from December 4, 1973, until May 7, 1974;
                    Secretary of the Treasury from May 8, 1974, until January 20, 1977
